        {
          "q": "Find the exact value of $\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{12}$.",
          "answer": "$\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{12} = \\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{4} - \\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4} = \\frac{\\sqrt{6} - \\sqrt{2}}{4}$."
        },
        {
          "q": "Find the exact value of $\\tan 105°$.",
          "answer": "$\\tan 105° = \\tan(60° + 45°) = \\frac{\\sqrt{3} + 1}{1 - \\sqrt{3}}$. Rationalizing: $\\frac{(\\sqrt{3} + 1)^2}{(1 - \\sqrt{3})(1 + \\sqrt{3})} = \\frac{4 + 2\\sqrt{3}}{-2} = -2 - \\sqrt{3}$."
        }
